# RequestReview: SemQL enricher on GovernanceRule of the GovernanceRules accelerator. Stepper only (Rule review workflow, steward task): sets the requested outcome.
_package: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.enrichers
_type: SemQLEnricher
_name: RequestReview
entity: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.GovernanceRule
label: Request review
description: 'Stepper only (Rule review workflow, steward task): sets the requested outcome. With a retirement date and a retirement reason the
  status becomes RETIREMENT_REQUESTED, otherwise IN_REVIEW (approval of a new or changed rule).'
enricherExecutionScope: NONE
semQlEnricherExpressions:
- attributeName: LifecycleStatus
  expression: CASE WHEN RetirementDate IS NOT NULL AND RetirementReason IS NOT NULL THEN 'RETIREMENT_REQUESTED' ELSE 'IN_REVIEW' END
